First, you 'E'ngrave on the floor with anything (fingers work the best as
they don't do anything.)  Then, you 'E'ngrave with your wand and add to the
engraving.

Once you finish engraving, a message should appear giving a clue to what
the wand does.  For example, a wand of slow monster will report "The bugs
on the floor slow down!"  Other wands will produce their regular effect.

There are only three wands that you cannot uniquely identify by the message
alone.  As a result, you will have to find out another method to identify
them.   





